ia/james-joyce"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/james-joyce.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">James Joyce</span><span class="tp">1882–1941</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/do-muoi"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/do-muoi.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Do Muoi</span><span class="tp">1917–2018</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/than-shwe"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/than-shwe.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Than Shwe</span><span class="tp">b. 1933</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
<section class="day-ppl" aria-labelledby="day-died"><h2 class="ref-sec-title" id="day-died">Died on 2 February <span class="n">8</span></h2><ul class="enc-seealso"><li><a href="/encyclopedia/konstantin-of-rostov"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/konstantin-of-rostov.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Konstantin of Rostov</span><span class="tp">1186–1218</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/louis-ii-duke-of-bavaria"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/louis-ii-duke-of-bavaria.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Louis II, Duke of Bavaria</span><span class="tp">1229–1294</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/joanna-ii-of-naples"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/joanna-ii-of-naples.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Joanna II of Naples</span><span class="tp">1373–1435</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/hatuey"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/hatuey.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Hatuey</span><span class="tp">d. 1512</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/gaston-duke-of-orleans"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/gaston-duke-of-orleans.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Gaston, Duke of Orléans</span><span class="tp">1608–1660</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/abraham-duquesne"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/abraham-duquesne.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Abraham Duquesne</span><span class="tp">c. 1610–1688</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/pope-clement-xiii"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/pope-clement-xiii.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Pope Clement XIII</span><span class="tp">1693–1769</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/constantin-caratheodory"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/constantin-caratheodory.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Constantin Carathéodory</span><span class="tp">1873–1950</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
<p class="day-ppl-note">Dates as the sources give them: in the Julian calendar before 1582, and in some countries for longer (Britain until 1752, Russia until 1918). Only people whose day of birth or death the records agree on are listed.</p>
